<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Proofs for guided DDPM</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To address technical issues in applying Itô’s lemma, we first establish that the trajectory <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{{z}_{t}\}_{t=0}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{{z}_{t}\}_{t=0}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> defined in Eq. (<a href="#S4.E17" title="Equation 17 ‣ 4.2 Intuition: reformulating DDPM with guidance ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>) eventually enters an <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>-neighborhood of a smooth approximation to <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmthm1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_thm">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmthm1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem C.1</span></span><span id="A3.Thmthm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmthm1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmthm1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmthm1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>,
assume that <math id="A3.Thmthm1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}\subseteq\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}\subseteq\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is a convex set with smooth boundary and <math id="A3.Thmthm1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>,
where <math id="A3.Thmthm1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\cdot,\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\cdot,\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the Hausdorff distance (see Definition <a href="#A1.Thmdefn1" title="Definition A.1 (Hausdorff distance). ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>).
Then, almost surely,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex92" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\limsup_{t\to T^{-}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq(4\gamma+6)\varepsilon." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim sup</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\limsup_{t\to T^{-}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq(4\gamma+6)\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS3" title="C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.3</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Fix any <math id="A3.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;\varepsilon&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;\varepsilon&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>.
By the main theorem in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Firey (1974)</a></cite>, there exists a smooth, convex, compact domain <math id="A3.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A3.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.
Applying <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, we then have that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx92" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex93"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(K_{\eta_{0}},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq(4\gamma+7)\varepsilon." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim sup</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim sup</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(K_{\eta_{0}},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq(4\gamma+7)\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS1.p3.2" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A3.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> is arbitrary, the conclusion follows.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Note that SDE (<a href="#S4.E15" title="Equation 15 ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>) can be reformulated as follows: for <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx93" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex94"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\widehat{x}_{t}-\widehat{x}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}t-\sqrt{2}\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\widehat{x}_{t}-\widehat{x}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}t-\sqrt{2}\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex95"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\{\,\frac{2\gamma\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big(\overline{m}_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})-\frac{\widehat{x}_{t_{k}}}{\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}\Big)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\overline{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})\Big(\overline{m}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})-\frac{\widehat{x}_{t_{k}}}{\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}\Big)\Big\}\mathrm{d}t." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\{\,\frac{2\gamma\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big(\overline{m}_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})-\frac{\widehat{x}_{t_{k}}}{\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}\Big)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\overline{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})\Big(\overline{m}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{x}_{t_{k}})-\frac{\widehat{x}_{t_{k}}}{\lambda_{T-t_{k}}}\Big)\Big\}\mathrm{d}t.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Define <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{z}_{t}=\lambda_{T-t_{k}}^{-1}\widehat{x}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{z}_{t}=\lambda_{T-t_{k}}^{-1}\widehat{x}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then for <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx94" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}t-\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}\\
&amp;=\Big\{\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\big(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}({\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}})-{\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}}\big)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big)\Big\}\,\mathrm{d}t.\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}t-\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}\\
&amp;=\Big\{\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\big(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}({\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}})-{\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}}\big)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big)\Big\}\,\mathrm{d}t.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(56)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The above equation further implies that for <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx95" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\\
&amp;=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\Big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)\Big).\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\\
&amp;=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\Big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)\Big).\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(57)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">For notational simplicity, we define</p>
<table id="A3.EGx96" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle v_{k}=\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle v_{k}=\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(58)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Substituting this notation into <a href="#A3.E57" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">57</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E56" title="Equation 56 ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">56</span></a>, we see that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx97" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}=\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}+(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)v_{k},\\
&amp;\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}=\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t.\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}=\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}+(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)v_{k},\\
&amp;\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}=\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(59)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Applying Itô’s formula to the differential of <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> and using <a href="#A3.E59" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a>, we obtain</p>
<table id="A3.EGx98" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathrm{d}\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}=2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t\\
&amp;=2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t\\
&amp;=2\,\left\langle\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}+(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)v_{k},\,\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t\right\rangle\\
&amp;\,\,\,\,\,\,\,+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t+2\,\left\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t\right\rangle.\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>dB</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>dB</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathrm{d}\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}=2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t\\
&amp;=2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t}-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2\,\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\mathrm{d}\widehat{z}_{t}\Big\rangle+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t\\
&amp;=2\,\left\langle\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}+(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)v_{k},\,\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t\right\rangle\\
&amp;\,\,\,\,\,\,\,+2de^{2T-2t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t+2\,\left\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,\sqrt{2}e^{T-t_{k}}\mathrm{d}B_{t}+e^{t-t_{k}}v_{k}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{t-t_{k}}\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\mathrm{d}B_{s}\mathrm{d}t\right\rangle.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(60)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.7" class="ltx_p">We next analyze the above terms in different phases depending on the value of <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.1</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Define <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{0}=\inf_{y\in K_{\eta},\,y^{\prime}\in K_{\eta^{\prime}},\,\eta\neq\eta^{\prime}}\|y-y^{\prime}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>η</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≠</mo><msup><mi>η</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{0}=\inf_{y\in K_{\eta},\,y^{\prime}\in K_{\eta^{\prime}},\,\eta\neq\eta^{\prime}}\|y-y^{\prime}\|</annotation></semantics></math>.
Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>,
with a sufficiently small <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa_{0}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_{0}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> depending only on <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;\tau_{0}&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;\tau_{0}&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math> that also depends only on <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>,
such that for all <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math> that satisfies <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, for all <math id="A3.Thmlem1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx99" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex96"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex96.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem1" title="Lemma C.1. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem1" title="Lemma C.1. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS4" title="C.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.4</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A3.Thmlem1" title="Lemma C.1. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> shows that <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}]</annotation></semantics></math> decreases on the interval <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, provided that <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>.
Since <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\geq\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}})\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\geq\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}})\right\|</annotation></semantics></math>,
we conclude that as long as <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx100" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex97"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex97.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\,\mathrm{d}t\leq-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.170em">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\,\mathrm{d}t\leq-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\implies\mathbb{E}\big[\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\cdot\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">⟹</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\implies\mathbb{E}\big[\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\cdot\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(61)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Define <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{\tau}=\inf\{k:\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;d_{0}/3\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>τ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\tau}=\inf\{k:\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;d_{0}/3\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Consider a sequence of random variables <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{Y_{k}\}_{k\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{Y_{k}\}_{k\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math> defined by</p>
<table id="A3.EGx101" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.EGx101.1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.EGx101.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Y_{k+1}=\left\{\begin{array}[]{ll}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2},&amp;k&lt;\widetilde{\tau},\\
\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\cdot Y_{k}&amp;k\geq\widetilde{\tau}.\end{array}\right." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>τ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>τ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Y_{k+1}=\left\{\begin{array}[]{ll}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2},&amp;k&lt;\widetilde{\tau},\\
\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\cdot Y_{k}&amp;k\geq\widetilde{\tau}.\end{array}\right.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p4.3" class="ltx_p">By the definition of <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\{Y_{k}\right\}_{k\geq 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\{Y_{k}\right\}_{k\geq 1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <a href="#A3.Ex97" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">61</span></a>,
for all <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\mathbb{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx102" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E62.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[Y_{k+1}\mid Y_{k}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\,Y_{k}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[Y_{k+1}\mid Y_{k}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\,Y_{k}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(62)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.p4.4" class="ltx_p">Now, <a href="#S3.Thmass2" title="Assumption 3.2. ‣ 3.1 Summary of main results ‣ 3 Results for DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Assumption</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a> implies that <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{k}\leq\frac{\kappa}{1+\kappa}(T-t_{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{k}\leq\frac{\kappa}{1+\kappa}(T-t_{k})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}\geq 1/[2(T-t_{k})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}\geq 1/[2(T-t_{k})]</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> large enough.
Consequently, the series <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k\geq 1}\Delta_{k}/\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}=\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k\geq 1}\Delta_{k}/\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}=\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
Hence, by a variant of the Robbins-Siegmund Theorem <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Polyak and others, 2021</a>, Lemma 10, Chapter 2)</cite>, we see that <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> converges almost surely to <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math>.
As a consequence, almost surely there exists <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}\in\mathbb{N}_{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}\in\mathbb{N}_{+}</annotation></semantics></math>, such that <math id="A3.SS2.p4.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k_{1}}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k_{1}}},K_{\eta_{0}})&lt;d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.2</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>,
with a sufficiently small <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa_{0}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_{0}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>,
for any <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon\in(0,\min\{1,d_{0}/3\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon\in(0,\min\{1,d_{0}/3\})</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;\tau_{\varepsilon}&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;\tau_{\varepsilon}&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math> that depends solely on <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math> that satisfies <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{0}/3&gt;\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{0}/3&gt;\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{\varepsilon},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{\varepsilon},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, for all <math id="A3.Thmlem2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx103" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex100"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex100.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem2" title="Lemma C.2. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem2" title="Lemma C.2. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS5" title="C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">We complete the proof with the next lemma.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.3</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>,
with a sufficiently small <math id="A3.Thmlem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa_{0}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_{0}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.Thmlem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, almost surely</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx104" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex101"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex101.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\limsup_{k\to\infty}\,\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\leq\varepsilon." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim sup</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\limsup_{k\to\infty}\,\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\leq\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem3" title="Lemma C.3. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.3</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem3" title="Lemma C.3. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.3</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS6" title="C.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1 Summary of main results ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a> follows immediately from Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem3" title="Lemma C.3. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For convenience, we introduce the following notation:</p>
<table id="A3.EGx105" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex102"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex102.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}z_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}z_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex102.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{\Big\{\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})F_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\Big\}}_{b(t,z_{t})}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{T-t}\mathrm{d}B_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{\Big\{\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})F_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\Big\}}_{b(t,z_{t})}\mathrm{d}t+\sqrt{2}e^{T-t}\mathrm{d}B_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In the next lemma, we express differences of distances in terms of integrals.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.4</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, let <math id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({z}_{t})_{0\leq t&lt;T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({z}_{t})_{0\leq t&lt;T}</annotation></semantics></math> be the process defined in Eq. (<a href="#S4.E17" title="Equation 17 ‣ 4.2 Intuition: reformulating DDPM with guidance ‣ 4 Results for DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>).
Then for any <math id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{z}_{t}\not\in\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∉</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{z}_{t}\not\in\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx106" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex103"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex103.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)=f(t,{z}_{t})\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}{W}_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)=f(t,{z}_{t})\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}{W}_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx107" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex104"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex104.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f(t,{z}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f(t,{z}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex104.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,{z}_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,{z}_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and <math id="A3.Thmlem4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({W}_{t})_{t\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({W}_{t})_{t\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes a standard one-dimensional Brownian motion.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem4" title="Lemma C.4. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.4</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem4" title="Lemma C.4. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.4</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS7" title="C.7 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.7</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">We then show that the distance to <math id="A3.SS3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> decreases to a certain level.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.5</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumptions of Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, there exists <math id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\varepsilon}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\varepsilon}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\varepsilon}\leq\tau&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\varepsilon}\leq\tau&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math>, if <math id="A3.Thmlem5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex105" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex105.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}\left(\exists\,\tau\leq s&lt;T\text{ such that }\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\,\Big|\,z_{\tau}\right)=1." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">∃</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"> such that </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" mathsize="1.600em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}\left(\exists\,\tau\leq s&lt;T\text{ such that }\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\,\Big|\,z_{\tau}\right)=1.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS8" title="C.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.8</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Next, we show that the distance increases to a certain level only finitely many times.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmlem6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmlem6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma C.6</span></span><span id="A3.Thmlem6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmlem6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\varepsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math> be as defined in Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a>, and <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.
Define <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}</annotation></semantics></math> as the number of upcrossings of <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2a</annotation></semantics></math> over the interval <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[t_{\varepsilon},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[t_{\varepsilon},T)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then almost surely <math id="A3.Thmlem6.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}&lt;\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}&lt;\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A3.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS9" title="C.9 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.9</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">With the above two lemmas, we now prove Theorem <a href="#A3.Thmthm1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>.
For concreteness, let <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\Omega,\mathcal{F},\mathbb{P})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\Omega,\mathcal{F},\mathbb{P})</annotation></semantics></math> denote the probability space on which the process <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}))_{0\leq t&lt;T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}))_{0\leq t&lt;T}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined.
For instance, one may take the classical Wiener space equipped with the filtration generated by the coordinate process.
Fix <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, and let <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\varepsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math> be from Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a>.
Define the sets</p>
<table id="A3.EGx108" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex106"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex106.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex106.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\{\omega\in\Omega:\exists\,s\in[t_{\varepsilon},T)\text{ such that }\mathsf{dist}(z_{s}(\omega),\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;2a\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">∃</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> such that </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\{\omega\in\Omega:\exists\,s\in[t_{\varepsilon},T)\text{ such that }\mathsf{dist}(z_{s}(\omega),\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;2a\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex107"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex107.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle G</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex107.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\{\omega\in\Omega:\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t}(\omega),\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq 2a\right\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.111em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim sup</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\{\omega\in\Omega:\limsup_{t\to T}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t}(\omega),\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq 2a\right\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.2" class="ltx_p">We next prove that <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}(G)=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}(G)=1</annotation></semantics></math>.
Note that</p>
<table id="A3.Ex108" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex108.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}(G)=\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A)+\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A^{c}\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A^{c})=\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A)+\mathbb{P}(A^{c})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}(G)=\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A)+\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A^{c}\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A^{c})=\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)\cdot\mathbb{P}(A)+\mathbb{P}(A^{c}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.3" class="ltx_p">Hence, it suffices to show <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)=1</annotation></semantics></math>.
Define</p>
<table id="A3.Ex109" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex109.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="T_{\mathsf{Last}}=\inf\left\{m\geq 1:U_{I_{n}}=0,\,\forall\,n\geq m\right\}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>𝖫𝖺𝗌𝗍</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.337em">∀</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\mathsf{Last}}=\inf\left\{m\geq 1:U_{I_{n}}=0,\,\forall\,n\geq m\right\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(I_{m})_{m\geq 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(I_{m})_{m\geq 1}</annotation></semantics></math> are the intervals defined in the proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a>, and <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{I_{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{I_{m}}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the number of upcrossings of <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2a</annotation></semantics></math> within the interval <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Recall that <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{Hit}(a)=\inf\{t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Hit}(a)=\inf\{t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined in the proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a>.
Note that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx109" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex110"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex110.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle G</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex110.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T,\,\exists\tau\in[\mathsf{Hit}(a),\,T):\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq 2a,\,\forall\,s\geq\tau\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊇</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em">{</mo><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∃</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.337em">∀</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T,\,\exists\tau\in[\mathsf{Hit}(a),\,T):\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq 2a,\,\forall\,s\geq\tau\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex111"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex111.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{T_{\mathsf{Last}}&lt;\infty,\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>⊇</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>𝖫𝖺𝗌𝗍</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{T_{\mathsf{Last}}&lt;\infty,\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex112"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex112.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{U_{[\mathsf{Hit}(a),T)}&lt;\infty,\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T\right\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>⊇</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\supseteq\left\{U_{[\mathsf{Hit}(a),T)}&lt;\infty,\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T\right\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.5" class="ltx_p">By Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a>, conditioning on <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.Ex113" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex113.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}\left(\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T,\,U_{[\mathsf{Hit}(a),T)}&lt;\infty\mid A\right)=1." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}\left(\mathsf{Hit}(a)&lt;T,\,U_{[\mathsf{Hit}(a),T)}&lt;\infty\mid A\right)=1.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS3.p8.6" class="ltx_p">Therefore, <math id="A3.SS3.p8.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}\left(G\mid A\right)=1</annotation></semantics></math> as desired.
The proof is done.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.4 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem1" title="Lemma C.1. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall that <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{0}=\inf_{y\in K_{\eta},\,y^{\prime}\in K_{\eta^{\prime}},\,\eta\neq\eta^{\prime}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>η</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≠</mo><msup><mi>η</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{0}=\inf_{y\in K_{\eta},\,y^{\prime}\in K_{\eta^{\prime}},\,\eta\neq\eta^{\prime}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="D_{0}=\sup_{y,y^{\prime}\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo rspace="0em">∈</mo><mo lspace="0em">∪</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{0}=\sup_{y,y^{\prime}\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="R_{0}=\sup_{y\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo rspace="0em">∈</mo><mo lspace="0em">∪</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{0}=\sup_{y\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y\right\|</annotation></semantics></math>.
Similar to the derivation of <a href="#A2.E44" title="In B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">44</span></a>, we see that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx110" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex114"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex114.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left\langle\frac{\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\mathrm{Proj}_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})}{\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\mathrm{Proj}_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|},\,\gamma F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-(\gamma-1)\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Proj</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Proj</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left\langle\frac{\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\mathrm{Proj}_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})}{\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\mathrm{Proj}_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|},\,\gamma F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-(\gamma-1)\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex115"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex115.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)+\frac{2(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)+\frac{2(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex116"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex116.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,\,-\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,\,-\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Recall that <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined in <a href="#A3.E58" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a>.
Using the above upper bound and the fact <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right\|\leq R_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right\|\leq R_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx111" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex117"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex117.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex118"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex118.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\Big(\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)+R_{0}\Big)+\frac{2\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\Big(\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)+R_{0}\Big)+\frac{2\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex119"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex119.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Therefore, there exist <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{1},\kappa_{1}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{1},\kappa_{1}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depend only on <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{1},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{1},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{1}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx112" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E63"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E63.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{1}{4\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.507em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{1}{4\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(63)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Similar to the derivation of <a href="#A2.E48" title="In B.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">48</span></a>, we conclude that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx113" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex120"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex120.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex121"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex121.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)\Big\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\left(m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\left(m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\right)\Big\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex122"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex122.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\,(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big(\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\|+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big\|m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\,(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big(\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\|+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big\|m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\big\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex123"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex123.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\|\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|\Big)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\|\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|\Big)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex124"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex124.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\,(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\Big(\frac{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}+2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+R_{0}+\frac{2\gamma D_{0}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\,(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\Big(\frac{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}+2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+R_{0}+\frac{2\gamma D_{0}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex125"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex125.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{3(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)(\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}+2)^{2}\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{4}}+3(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)R_{0}^{2}+\frac{12(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\gamma^{2}D_{0}^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{4}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{3(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)(\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}+2)^{2}\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{4}}+3(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)R_{0}^{2}+\frac{12(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\gamma^{2}D_{0}^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{4}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Again, Assumption <a href="#S3.Thmass2" title="Assumption 3.2. ‣ 3.1 Summary of main results ‣ 3 Results for DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a> implies that <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(t-t_{k})/\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\lesssim\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(t-t_{k})/\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\lesssim\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>.
Hence, there exist <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{2},\kappa_{2}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{2},\kappa_{2}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depend only on <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>,
such that for all <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{2},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{2},T)</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A3.SS4.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{2}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<table id="A3.EGx114" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E64"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E64.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}\leq\frac{1}{20\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}\leq\frac{1}{20\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(64)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Substituting <a href="#A3.E63" title="In C.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">63</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E64" title="Equation 64 ‣ C.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">64</span></a> into <a href="#A3.E60" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">60</span></a>, we conclude that for all <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m19" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{1}\vee\tau_{2},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∨</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{1}\vee\tau_{2},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m21" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{1}\wedge\kappa_{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{1}\wedge\kappa_{2}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx115" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex126"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex126.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{2}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}\mathrm{d}t+2de^{2T+2t-4t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dt</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{2}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}\mathrm{d}t+2de^{2T+2t-4t_{k}}\mathrm{d}t.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.7" class="ltx_p">We can then conclude that there exist <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{0},\kappa_{0}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{0},\kappa_{0}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depend only on <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{0},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS4.p1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx116" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex127"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex127.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.8" class="ltx_p">completing the proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.5 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem2" title="Lemma C.2. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}=\lambda_{T-t}^{-2}\sigma_{T-t}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}=\lambda_{T-t}^{-2}\sigma_{T-t}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the constant associated with <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> from Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>.
By <a href="#A2.E52" title="In Case I: 𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍(𝑧̂_𝑡_𝑘,𝐾_𝜂_0)∈[𝜀,𝑑_0/3) ‣ B.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a>, for any <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> that satisfies <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z,K_{\eta_{0}})\leq d_{0}/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z,K_{\eta_{0}})\leq d_{0}/3</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx117" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z)\leq\frac{\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{d_{0}^{2}}{24\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z)\leq\frac{\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{d_{0}^{2}}{24\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(65)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Recall that <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined in <a href="#A3.E58" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a>.
For all <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx118" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex128"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex128.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\Big\|^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\Big\|^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.3" class="ltx_p">By Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Projection is to close to a tilted mean). ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>, for all <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta\in\mathcal{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta\in\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx119" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E66"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\left\|F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\leq\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta})+\left\|\Proj_{K_{\eta}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\\
&amp;\leq\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta})+C_{K_{\eta}}\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}\log\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{-1},\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.618em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.618em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\left\|F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\leq\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta})+\left\|\Proj_{K_{\eta}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-m_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|\\
&amp;\leq\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta})+C_{K_{\eta}}\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}\log\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{-1},\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(66)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{K_{\eta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{K_{\eta}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the constant from Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Projection is to close to a tilted mean). ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.
Combining <a href="#A3.E65" title="In C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">65</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E66" title="Equation 66 ‣ C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">66</span></a>, we obtain that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx120" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E67"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}&amp;=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\Big\|^{2}\\
&amp;\leq(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big(\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\|+\frac{2\gamma\big(\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+C_{K_{\eta_{0}}}\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}\log\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{-1}\big)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\\
&amp;\qquad+\frac{2(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|e^{-{d_{0}^{2}}/(24\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2})}(\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+D_{0})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}}}\Big)^{2},\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}&amp;=(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}+\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}F_{\eta_{0},T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})-\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})F_{\eta,T-t_{k}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\Big\|^{2}\\
&amp;\leq(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\cdot\Big(\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\|+\frac{2\gamma\big(\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+C_{K_{\eta_{0}}}\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}\log\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{-1}\big)}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\\
&amp;\qquad+\frac{2(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|e^{-{d_{0}^{2}}/(24\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2})}(\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})+D_{0})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}}}\Big)^{2},\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(67)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where the last inequality follows from a similar calculation as in <a href="#A2.E52" title="In Case I: 𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍(𝑧̂_𝑡_𝑘,𝐾_𝜂_0)∈[𝜀,𝑑_0/3) ‣ B.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a>.
Similar to the derivation of <a href="#A2.E44" title="In B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">44</span></a>, we conclude that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx121" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex129"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex129.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E68"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\Big(\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)+R_{0}\Big)+\frac{2\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\Big(\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)+R_{0}\Big)+\frac{2\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t_{k}}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(68)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex130"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex130.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\,\,\,\,\,+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t_{k}}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{4\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)\gamma\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{2}\log(\Xi_{T-t_{k}}^{-2})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Therefore, there exists <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{\tau}_{\varepsilon}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{\tau}_{\varepsilon}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,\varepsilon)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,\varepsilon)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\overline{\tau}_{\varepsilon},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\overline{\tau}_{\varepsilon},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx122" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E69"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E69.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{1}{2\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{1}{2\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(69)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.7" class="ltx_p">Substituting <a href="#A3.E67" title="In C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">67</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E69" title="Equation 69 ‣ C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">69</span></a> into <a href="#A3.E60" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">60</span></a>, we conclude that there exists <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\varepsilon}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\varepsilon}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depend only on <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T,\varepsilon)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T,\varepsilon)</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa_{0}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_{0}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau_{\varepsilon},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau_{\varepsilon},T)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa_{0}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS5.p1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})\geq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx123" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex131"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex131.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq-\frac{1}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}\big(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}}\big)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.8" class="ltx_p">The proof is done.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.6 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem3" title="Lemma C.3. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.3</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Taking expectation of both sides of <a href="#A3.E60" title="In C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">60</span></a> and differentiating,
we see that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx124" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex132"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex132.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\mathbb{E}\big[\left\|\widehat{z}_{t}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex133"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex133.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=4\cdot e^{t-t_{k}}\mathbb{E}\left\|\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\,\mathrm{d}B_{s}\right\|^{2}+2de^{2(T-t_{k})}+2e^{2(t-t_{k})}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=4\cdot e^{t-t_{k}}\mathbb{E}\left\|\int_{t_{k}}^{t}e^{T-s}\,\mathrm{d}B_{s}\right\|^{2}+2de^{2(T-t_{k})}+2e^{2(t-t_{k})}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex134"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex134.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=4\cdot e^{2(t-t_{k})}\cdot\frac{d}{2}\left(e^{2(T-t_{k})}-e^{2(T-t_{k})}\right)+2de^{2(T-t_{k})}+2e^{2(t-t_{k})}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=4\cdot e^{2(t-t_{k})}\cdot\frac{d}{2}\left(e^{2(T-t_{k})}-e^{2(T-t_{k})}\right)+2de^{2(T-t_{k})}+2e^{2(t-t_{k})}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex135"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex135.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex136"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex136.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2d\cdot e^{2(T-t_{k})+2(t-t_{k})}+2e^{t-t_{k}}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2d\cdot e^{2(T-t_{k})+2(t-t_{k})}+2e^{t-t_{k}}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\|v_{k}\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS6.p1.2" class="ltx_p">By <a href="#A3.E67" title="In C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">67</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E68" title="Equation 68 ‣ C.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">68</span></a>, we see that there exist <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{\prime},\kappa^{\prime},C^{\prime}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>κ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{\prime},\kappa^{\prime},C^{\prime}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> that depend only on <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\gamma,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\gamma,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in(0,\kappa^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>κ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in(0,\kappa^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k}\in[\tau^{\prime},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k}\in[\tau^{\prime},T)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx125" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex137"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex137.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 2de^{2T+2t-4t_{k}}+2e^{t-t_{k}}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}+\frac{C^{\prime}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 2de^{2T+2t-4t_{k}}+2e^{t-t_{k}}(e^{t-t_{k}}-1)\left\|v_{k}\right\|^{2}+2e^{t-t_{k}}\Big\langle\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}),\,v_{k}\Big\rangle\leq-\frac{\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}+\frac{C^{\prime}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS6.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\left\|\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}}-\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}})\right\|</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx126" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex138"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex138.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{C^{\prime}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}\mid\widehat{z}_{t_{k}}\big]\leq\Big(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}}\Big)\,\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}+\frac{C^{\prime}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS6.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Note that for all <math id="A3.SS6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k^{\prime}\in\mathbb{N}^{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k^{\prime}\in\mathbb{N}^{+}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx127" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex139"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex139.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{k=k^{\prime}}^{\infty}\frac{C^{\prime}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}&lt;\infty." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{k=k^{\prime}}^{\infty}\frac{C^{\prime}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})}{\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{3/2}}&lt;\infty.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Again, applying Lemma 10 in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Polyak and others, 2021</a>, Chapter 2)</cite>, we see that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> converges to a non-negative random variable <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, almost surely.
We claim that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L\leq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L\leq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> almost surely.
Towards a contradiction, suppose that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}(L&gt;\varepsilon)&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}(L&gt;\varepsilon)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then, with positive probability, there exists <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})&gt;\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k}},K_{\eta_{0}})&gt;\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq N</annotation></semantics></math>.
Write <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{Z_{k}\}_{k\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{Z_{k}\}_{k\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math> for</p>
<table id="A3.Ex140" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex140.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{k+1}=\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{k+1}=\mathsf{dist}(\widehat{z}_{t_{k+1}},K_{\eta_{0}})^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS6.p2.2" class="ltx_p">By Lemmas <a href="#A3.Thmlem1" title="Lemma C.1. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> and <a href="#A3.Thmlem2" title="Lemma C.2. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>, we see that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[Z_{k+1}\mid Z_{k}]\leq(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}})\,Z_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[Z_{k+1}\mid Z_{k}]\leq(1-\frac{t_{k+1}-t_{k}}{5\sigma_{T-t_{k}}^{2}})\,Z_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>.
By the same reasoning as in the paragraph preceding <a href="#A3.Thmlem2" title="Lemma C.2. ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>, we see that <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{k}\to 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{k}\to 0</annotation></semantics></math> almost surely as <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
A contradiction.
Therefore, <math id="A3.SS6.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L\leq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L\leq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> almost surely, completing the proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.7 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem4" title="Lemma C.4. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.4</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\partial\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\partial\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> is smooth,
Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> implies that the distance function <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(\cdot,\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(\cdot,\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})</annotation></semantics></math> is at least <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{d}\setminus\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo>∖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{d}\setminus\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Applying Itô’s formula, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx128" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex141"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex141.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex141.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}z_{t}\right\rangle+\frac{1}{2}\left\langle\nabla^{2}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\,\mathrm{d}z_{t},\,\mathrm{d}z_{t}\right\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}z_{t}\right\rangle+\frac{1}{2}\left\langle\nabla^{2}\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\,\mathrm{d}z_{t},\,\mathrm{d}z_{t}\right\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex142"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex142.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,z_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\right)\,\mathrm{d}t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,z_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\right)\,\mathrm{d}t</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex143"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex143.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\sqrt{2}e^{T-t}\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}\right\rangle." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\sqrt{2}e^{T-t}\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}\right\rangle.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS7.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Note that the process <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{W}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{W}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> defined by <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{d}{W}_{t}=\langle{\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{d}{W}_{t}=\langle{\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\mathrm{d}B_{t}}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> is a one-dimensional Brownian motion.
Indeed,
Itô isometry implies the quadratic variation of this process is <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[{W}]_{t}=t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[{W}]_{t}=t</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[{W}_{t}]=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[{W}_{t}]=0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, by Lévy’s characterization of Brownian motion <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Revuz and Yor, 2013</a>, Theorem 3.6 Chapter IV)</cite> <math id="A3.SS7.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{W}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{W}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> coincides in law with a standard one-dimensional Brownian motion.
Therefore,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx129" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex144"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex144.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)=f(t,{z}_{t})\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}{W}_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{d}\big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\big)=f(t,{z}_{t})\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}{W}_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS7.p1.3" class="ltx_p">completing the proof of the lemma.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.8 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem5" title="Lemma C.5. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">By our assumption that <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.E70" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E70.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})\right\|\leq\varepsilon." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\Proj_{K_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})\right\|\leq\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(70)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=\frac{z_{t}-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})}{\left\|z_{t}-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})\right\|}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=\frac{z_{t}-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})}{\left\|z_{t}-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})\right\|}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\right\|=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\right\|=1</annotation></semantics></math>. Note that for any <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq t&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq t&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx130" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex145"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex145.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(z_{t},t)\right\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(z_{t},t)\right\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex146"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex146.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(m_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(m_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})-z_{t})\right\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(m_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(m_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})-z_{t})\right\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex147"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex147.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(\Proj_{{K}_{\eta}}({z}_{t})-z_{t})\right\rangle}_{\rm I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mi>I</mi></munder></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-z_{t})-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(\Proj_{{K}_{\eta}}({z}_{t})-z_{t})\right\rangle}_{\rm I}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex148"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex148.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(m_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-\Proj_{{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t}))-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(m_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})-\Proj_{{K}_{\eta}}({z}_{t}))\right\rangle}_{\rm II}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mi>II</mi></munder></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(m_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})-\Proj_{{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t}))-\frac{2(\gamma-1)}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\sum_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}{\zeta}_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})(m_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})-\Proj_{{K}_{\eta}}({z}_{t}))\right\rangle}_{\rm II}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex149"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex149.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(\Proj_{{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t}))\right\rangle}_{\rm III}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗃</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mi>III</mi></munder></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\underbrace{\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,\frac{2\gamma}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}(\Proj_{{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t})-\Proj_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}({z}_{t}))\right\rangle}_{\rm III}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.3" class="ltx_p">To upper bound <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rm{III}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>III</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rm{III}</annotation></semantics></math>, note that<a href="#A3.E70" title="In C.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">70</span></a> and the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality imply that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx131" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E71"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{|\rm{III}|}\leq\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>III</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{|\rm{III}|}\leq\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(71)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.4" class="ltx_p">To upper bound <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rm{II}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>II</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rm{II}</annotation></semantics></math>, Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Projection is to close to a tilted mean). ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a> implies that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx132" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E72"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E72.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{|\rm{II}|}\leq\frac{(4\gamma-2)\log\sigma_{T-t}^{-1}\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}}{\sigma_{T-t}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>II</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{|\rm{II}|}\leq\frac{(4\gamma-2)\log\sigma_{T-t}^{-1}\sup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}C_{K_{\eta}}}{\sigma_{T-t}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(72)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{K_{\eta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{K_{\eta}}</annotation></semantics></math> is from Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Projection is to close to a tilted mean). ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.
As for term <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rm{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rm{I}</annotation></semantics></math>, similar to the derivation of <a href="#A2.E32" title="In B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">32</span></a> and using the upper bound <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝖧</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{d}_{\mathsf{H}}(\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}},K_{\eta_{0}})\leq\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.EGx133" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex150"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex150.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\rm{I}}\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\rm{I}}\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex150.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\frac{2\gamma-2(\gamma-1)\zeta_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\frac{2\gamma-2(\gamma-1)\zeta_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex151"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex151.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex151.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\frac{2\gamma-2(\gamma-1)\zeta_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta})+\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\frac{2\gamma-2(\gamma-1)\zeta_{\eta_{0},T-t}(z_{t})}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma-2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\cdot\sum_{\eta\neq\eta_{0}}\zeta_{\eta,T-t}(z_{t})\cdot\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta})+\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Following the same argument as in the derivation of <a href="#A2.E44" title="In B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proofs for guided DDIM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">44</span></a>, we conclude that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx134" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E73"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E73.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\rm{I}}\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\rm{I}}\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E73.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{2D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right)+\frac{4(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t}}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{2D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right)+\frac{4(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t}}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},K_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{2\gamma\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(73)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex152"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex152.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex152.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{2D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right)+\frac{4(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t}}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{(2\gamma+2)\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{2D_{0}(\gamma-1)\left|\mathcal{I}\right|}{w_{\eta_{0}}\inf_{x\in\mathbb{R}^{d}}p_{\eta_{0}}(x)\cdot\rho_{\eta_{0}}\Xi_{T-t}^{d}\sigma^{2}_{T-t}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{3\Xi_{T-t}^{2}}{2\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}}\right)+\frac{4(\gamma-1)\Xi_{T-t}}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}-\frac{2}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})+\frac{(2\gamma+2)\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.7" class="ltx_p">where we recall <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m10" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="D_{0}=\sup_{y,y^{\prime}\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo rspace="0em">∈</mo><mo lspace="0em">∪</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi></mrow></msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{0}=\sup_{y,y^{\prime}\in\cup_{\eta\in\mathcal{I}}K_{\eta}}\left\|y-y^{\prime}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Xi_{T-t}=\sqrt{\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ξ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Xi_{T-t}=\sqrt{\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}=\lambda_{T-t}^{-2}\sigma_{T-t}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\sigma}_{T-t}^{2}=\lambda_{T-t}^{-2}\sigma_{T-t}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.
The above upper bounds apply to any <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[0,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[0,T)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Combining <a href="#A3.E71" title="In C.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eqs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">71</span></a>, <a href="#A3.E72" title="Equation 72 ‣ C.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">72</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E73" title="Equation 73 ‣ C.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">73</span></a>, we see that there exists <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\varepsilon}&gt;T-1/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\varepsilon}&gt;T-1/2</annotation></semantics></math> that depends only on <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p_{0},\varepsilon,\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>,
such that for any <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{\varepsilon},T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{\varepsilon},T)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})&gt;(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx135" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex153"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex153.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f(t,z_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f(t,z_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex153.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,z_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\langle\nabla\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}),\,b(t,z_{t})\right\rangle+e^{2(T-t)}\Delta\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex154"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex154.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq-\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\Big(2\,\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})-(4\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)+e\,\mathcal{C}_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}\leq-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq-\frac{1}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\Big(2\,\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})-(4\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)+e\,\mathcal{C}_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}\leq-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.8" class="ltx_p">where we recall that <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined in Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ Appendix A Technical lemmas ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>.
Consider the one-dimensional Itô process <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(X_{t})_{\tau\leq t&lt;T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(X_{t})_{\tau\leq t&lt;T}</annotation></semantics></math> defined by</p>
<table id="A3.E74" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{d}X_{t}=-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{t},\qquad X_{\tau}=\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{d}X_{t}=-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{t},\qquad X_{\tau}=\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(74)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.9" class="ltx_p">By a comparison theorem for SDEs <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ikeda and Watanabe, 2014</a>, Chapter VI, Theorem 1.1)</cite>, we obtain that almost surely,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx136" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex155"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex155.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq X_{t},\quad\text{for all }t\in[\tau,\,\widetilde{T})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>for all </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})\leq X_{t},\quad\text{for all }t\in[\tau,\,\widetilde{T}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex156"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex156.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\widetilde{T}=\min\big\{\inf\{s&gt;\tau:\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\},\,T\big\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\widetilde{T}=\min\big\{\inf\{s&gt;\tau:\mathsf{dist}(z_{s},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\},\,T\big\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.10" class="ltx_p">Therefore, it suffices to show that almost surely there exists <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[\tau,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[\tau,T)</annotation></semantics></math>, such that <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{s}=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{s}=(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.
This is equivalent to proving that almost surely <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widetilde{T}&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{T}&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math>.
Note that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx137" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex157"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex157.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\big(\widetilde{T}=T\big)\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\inf_{\tau\leq t&lt;T}X_{t}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)\leq\inf_{s_{i}\to T^{-}}\,\mathbb{P}\Big(X_{s_{i}}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\big(\widetilde{T}=T\big)\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\inf_{\tau\leq t&lt;T}X_{t}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)\leq\inf_{s_{i}\to T^{-}}\,\mathbb{P}\Big(X_{s_{i}}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.11" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> is a sequence in <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\tau,T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\tau,T)</annotation></semantics></math> that converges to <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
In addition,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx138" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex158"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex158.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\Big(X_{s_{i}}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)=\mathbb{P}\Big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})-\int_{\tau}^{s_{i}}\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}+\int_{\tau}^{s_{i}}e^{2(T-t)}\mathrm{d}W_{t}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\Big(X_{s_{i}}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big)=\mathbb{P}\Big(\mathsf{dist}(z_{\tau},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})-\int_{\tau}^{s_{i}}\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}+\int_{\tau}^{s_{i}}e^{2(T-t)}\mathrm{d}W_{t}\geq(2\gamma+3)\varepsilon\Big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.12" class="ltx_p">which converges to zero as <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
This proves that <math id="A3.SS8.p1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}(\widetilde{T}=T)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}(\widetilde{T}=T)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, completing the proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.9 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A3.Thmlem6" title="Lemma C.6. ‣ C.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs for guided DDPM ‣ On the Robustness of Distribution Support under Diffusion Guidance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.6</span></a></h3>

<div id="A3.SS9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If there does not exist <math id="A3.SS9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq t_{\varepsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq t_{\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A3.SS9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A3.SS9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{[t_{\varepsilon},T)}=0</annotation></semantics></math>.
In what follows, we condition on the event <math id="A3.SS9.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\exists\,t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">∃</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\exists\,t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS9.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Define <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{Hit}(a)=\inf\{t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Hit}(a)=\inf\{t\geq t_{\varepsilon}:\mathsf{dist}({z}_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Define a sequence of intervals <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(I_{m})_{m\geq 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(I_{m})_{m\geq 1}</annotation></semantics></math> by</p>
<table id="A3.EGx139" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex159"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex159.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle I_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle I_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex159.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left[\mathsf{Hit}(a),\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)+\frac{T-\mathsf{Hit}(a)}{2}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left[\mathsf{Hit}(a),\,\mathsf{Hit}(a)+\frac{T-\mathsf{Hit}(a)}{2}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex160"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex160.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle I_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle I_{m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex160.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left[I_{m-1}^{r},\,I_{m-1}^{r}+\frac{T-I_{m-1}^{r}}{2}\right]\quad\text{for }m&gt;1," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>r</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>r</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext>for </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left[I_{m-1}^{r},\,I_{m-1}^{r}+\frac{T-I_{m-1}^{r}}{2}\right]\quad\text{for }m&gt;1,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where we write <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{m}=[I_{m}^{\ell},I_{m}^{r}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{m}=[I_{m}^{\ell},I_{m}^{r}]</annotation></semantics></math>.
By construction, the length of <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|I_{m}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|I_{m}\right|</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))/2^{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))/2^{m}</annotation></semantics></math>.
For each <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>, define the event <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="E_{m}=\left\{U_{I_{m}}\geq 1\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{m}=\left\{U_{I_{m}}\geq 1\right\}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{I_{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{I_{m}}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the number of upcrossings of <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2a</annotation></semantics></math> over the interval <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>.
We next show that <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}(E_{m}\text{ i.o.})=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> i.o.</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}(E_{m}\text{ i.o.})=0</annotation></semantics></math> (i.o. stands for infinitely often).
Consider the one-dimensional Itô process <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(X_{t})_{\tau_{m}\leq t&lt;I_{m}^{r}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(X_{t})_{\tau_{m}\leq t&lt;I_{m}^{r}}</annotation></semantics></math> defined by</p>
<table id="A3.E75" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E75.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{d}X_{t}=-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{t},\qquad X_{\tau_{m}}=a." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{d}X_{t}=-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+e^{2(T-t)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{t},\qquad X_{\tau_{m}}=a.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(75)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the first time that <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝖽𝗂𝗌𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{dist}(z_{t},\widetilde{K}_{\eta_{0}})=a</annotation></semantics></math> within the interval <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> conditioned on the event <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Applying the SDE comparison theorem again, we see that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx140" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex161"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex161.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle E_{m}\subseteq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle E_{m}\subseteq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex161.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\{\,\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}X_{t}\geq 2a\Big\}\subseteq\Big\{\,\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a\Big\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\{\,\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}X_{t}\geq 2a\Big\}\subseteq\Big\{\,\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a\Big\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex162"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex162.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\subseteq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊆</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\subseteq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex162.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\cup\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\cup\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.4" class="ltx_p">Note that the quadratic variation of the process <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{T-s}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{T-s}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> is upper bounded by</p>
<table id="A3.Ex163" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex163.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}s\leq\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{I_{m}^{r}}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}s\leq e\left|I_{m}\right|." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></msubsup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}s\leq\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{I_{m}^{r}}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}s\leq e\left|I_{m}\right|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.5" class="ltx_p">Applying Bernstein’s maximal inequality (see <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">McKean, 2024</a>, Section 2.3)</cite> or <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Revuz and Yor, 2013</a>, Exercise 3.16 Chapter IV)</cite>), we see that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx141" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex164"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex164.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex164.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}X_{t}\geq 2a\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}X_{t}\geq 2a\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex165"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex165.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\Big[\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\Big]\geq a\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\Big[\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}-\frac{\varepsilon}{\sigma_{T-t}^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}t+\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\Big]\geq a\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex166"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex166.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\left(\max_{\tau_{m}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{\tau_{m}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex167"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex167.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\cup\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\cup\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex168"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex168.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\Big)+\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">inf</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\max_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\geq a/2\,\Big\}\Big)+\mathbb{P}\Big(\Big\{\inf_{I_{m}^{l}\leq t\leq I_{m}^{r}}\int_{I_{m}^{l}}^{t}e^{2(T-s)}\,\mathrm{d}W_{s}\leq-a/2\,\Big\}\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex169"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex169.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}}{4e\left|I_{m}\right|}\right)=2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}\cdot 2^{m}}{4e(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}}{4e\left|I_{m}\right|}\right)=2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}\cdot 2^{m}}{4e(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.6" class="ltx_p">where the third inequality follows from the fact that <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> has a negative drift.
Therefore,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex170" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex170.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{m\geq 1}\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\right)\leq\sum_{m\geq 1}2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}\cdot 2^{m}}{4e(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))}\right)&lt;\infty." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝖧𝗂𝗍</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{m\geq 1}\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\right)\leq\sum_{m\geq 1}2\exp\left(-\frac{a^{2}\cdot 2^{m}}{4e(T-\mathsf{Hit}(a))}\right)&lt;\infty.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS9.p2.7" class="ltx_p">The first Borel-Cantelli lemma implies that <math id="A3.SS9.p2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\text{ i.o.}\right)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> i.o.</mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}\left(E_{m}\text{ i.o.}\right)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, completing the proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
